event: template_sections
data: {"sections":[{"section_id":"header","type":"template","content":"LEGAL NOTICE\n(Under Section 138 read with Section 142 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881)\n\nDate: 06 May 2026\nBy Registered Post A.D. / Speed Post / UPC\n\nTo,\nMr. Dilip Kumar Singh\nHouse No. 102, Bariatu, Ranchi - 834009\n\nFrom,\nMr. Sanjay Prasad\nThrough: Adv. Neelam Kumari, Advocate\nChamber 21, District Court Compound, Ranchi - 834001","alignment":"left"},{"section_id":"subject_line","type":"template","content":"Subject: Statutory Demand Notice under Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881 — Cheque No. 672145 dated 10.04.2026 for Rs. 225000/- (Two Lakh Twenty Five Thousand only) drawn on State Bank of India, Main Branch, Ranchi — dishonoured on 17.04.2026\n\nSir/Madam,\n\nUnder instructions from and on behalf of my client, Mr. Sanjay Prasad, I hereby serve upon you this statutory notice under Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881, and call upon you to note as under:","alignment":"left"},{"section_id":"body","type":"ai_generated","content":"1. That my client had entered into a sale agreement dated 01.02.2026 with the noticee for the sale of a used Mahindra Thar vehicle bearing registration number JH-01-AB-1234. As per the terms of the said agreement, the noticee Mr. Dilip Kumar Singh became liable to pay the balance amount of Rs. 2,25,000/- (Rupees Two Lakh Twenty Five Thousand only) towards the sale consideration of the aforesaid vehicle.\n\n2. That towards the discharge of the said liability, the noticee Mr. Dilip Kumar Singh issued Cheque No. 672145 dated 10.04.2026 for Rs. 2,25,000/- (Rupees Two Lakh Twenty Five Thousand only) drawn on State Bank of India, Main Branch, Ranchi in favour of my client.\n\n3. That the said cheque was duly presented by my client to his banker for collection on 15.04.2026. However, the said cheque was returned dishonoured by the drawee bank vide return memo dated 17.04.2026 with the endorsement \"Account Closed\".\n\n4. That the dishonour of the aforesaid cheque by the noticee Mr. Dilip Kumar Singh constitutes a criminal offence punishable under Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881, which prescribes punishment with imprisonment for a term which may extend to two years, or with fine which may extend to twice the amount of the cheque, or with both.\n\n5. That as per the proviso (b) to Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881, the payee is required to make a demand for the payment of the said amount of money to the drawer of the cheque within thirty days of the receipt of information by him from the bank regarding the return of the cheque as unpaid.\n\n6. That my client received information about the dishonour of the aforesaid cheque on 19.04.2026, and this notice is being served well within the statutory period of thirty days as mandated under the provisions of Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881."},{"section_id":"demand_clause","type":"template","content":"DEMAND\n\nYou are hereby called upon to make payment of the said sum of Rs. 225000/- (Two Lakh Twenty Five Thousand only) to my client within a period of fifteen (15) days from the date of receipt of this notice, failing which my client shall be constrained to initiate criminal proceedings against you under Section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881, before the competent Magistrate having jurisdiction, at your risk, cost, and consequences.\n\nPlease note that under Section 138, if you fail to make payment within 15 days of receipt of this notice, my client shall file a criminal complaint within 30 days thereafter, and upon conviction you shall be liable to imprisonment for a term which may extend to two years, or with fine which may extend to twice the amount of the cheque, or with both.","alignment":"left"},{"section_id":"closing","type":"template","content":"A copy of this notice is retained in my office for record and further legal action.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\n\n_________________________\nAdv. Neelam Kumari\nAdvocate\nEnrollment No. JHC/1893/2019\nChamber 21, District Court Compound, Ranchi - 834001\n\n(Counsel for Mr. Sanjay Prasad)","alignment":"left"},{"section_id":"disclaimer","type":"template","content":"AI-assisted draft — verify with applicable law before filing. Lawie does not provide legal advice.","alignment":"center","style":"footer_small_gray"}]}

