data: {"items":["Send within 30 days of receiving dishonour information (bank memo date)","Send via Registered Post AD — retain postal receipt","Send additional copy via Speed Post / UPC for safety","Retain original dishonoured cheque safely (primary evidence)","Retain bank return memo / dishonour slip","Wait 15 days from date of receipt by noticee","If no payment within 15 days — file complaint within next 30 days (S.142(1)(b))","Keep AD card as proof of service","Verify noticee's correct residential / business address"]}

